1
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,280
What about Brian Ward? Luigi! Answer that!

2
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,710
Everyone's using that shot. What can we actually stand behind?

3
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:50,140
She's saying the transfer isn't a verdict. That's the lawyer talking, not him.

4
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:52,270
Fine. Use that.

5
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:03,660
The link's right there. If they want to read it, they can.

6
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,530
We've got three events, plus escorts this weekend. Security wants a deposit today.

7
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,980
Pay them. The review hires can wait.

8
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,830
We're behind already. Who's supposed to get through these?

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,830
These aren't new positions. I'm replacing people who left.

10
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,200
Not today.

11
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:56,280
Bring me the oldest cases on Monday.

12
00:01:56,630 --> 00:01:59,840
I'll bring the vacancy list, too.

13
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:16,660
When its wings get tired, it can run. Look at the feet.

14
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:29,710
I did. Four feet. Just let me deal with this.

15
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:40,760
No, the renewal. The clinic sent everything again.

16
00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:44,790
It's still showing 'documentation incomplete.'

17
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:57,710
Can you keep Friday open? Until they call me back?

18
00:02:58,060 --> 00:03:06,980
I can see her today. But billing needs a payment plan for Friday. Come in when you're done.

19
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:16,190
Someone from review will call the number we have on file.

20
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:22,130
What number will they call from? Wait, I'm getting all these—

21
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:30,190
Did anyone even open it? Can you just tell me that?

22
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,400
They put my name up. And the store.

23
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,400
Can you stay? Just till I've called them.

24
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,980
Okay. Lock up. I'll call my ride.
